  "details": "When placing a new sticker the old location shows for a brief moment.\n\nhowto?\n\nGo into placing a sticker.\n\nCancel with the menu button\n\nAim somewhere else and select a new sticker.\n\nMore often than not you'll briefly see the old sticker placement guide before it updates to where you are now aiming.\n\nWould look way cleaner if the laser didn't enable until it's in the new location.\n\nVideo showing problem. It's more visible in game for me. -> https://youtu.be/XXIZe-Jgjg8",
